  "title": "Email deliverability across APAC: Navigating a diverse digital landscape",
  "summary": "APAC is one of the most exciting and complex email markets in the world. The regulatory diversity, the ISP fragmentation, and the sheer range of consumer behaviors across the region mean that a single global email strategy will almost always underperform a thoughtfully localized one. The good news is that the fundamentals hold across every market. Get those right, build in the market-specific nuances on top, and your APAC program will be on solid ground.",
